(global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 393.7 340.36 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "d4aa3764-6a00-4bcf-8585-f0f3d8e7aa22") (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 393.7 340.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))))
(text "Differences from the C-Media demo board:" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 376 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "76e3f91d-f3a6-49fe-bba4-a5faf7e52cf0"))
(text "1. Supply: VBUS through a TPS22919 load switch (soft start 1.3 ms, output discharge) to AUD_5V, ON = P1.02 with a 100k pull-down: the sound card is" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 379.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "94edccc4-57de-4e1f-9ec7-ba9029c500bf"))
(text "   powered only in USB mode (firmware src/audio_gate.rs). A hard switch-on would dip VBUS enough to reset the hub (CH334 datasheet 6.1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 382.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "01a14b4d-c097-443c-bc2b-18df0660fe80"))
(text "2. Headphones: a TPA6132A2 DirectPath amplifier after LOL / LOR (demo board: 100 uF + 39R straight to the jack): about 0 ohm output impedance, no" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 385.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3a6241c5-c4d7-4584-abf0-42bb38732521"))
(text "   coupling capacitors, 0 dB gain (-6 dB with JP3 closed, for very sensitive earphones). Inputs single-ended through 1 uF (8 Hz); EN about 0.25 s" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 389.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bc235bd6-180b-473b-8b89-b383bffb725a"))
(text "   after the supply (1M + 470 nF from P1.02) and off at once through a Schottky. The switch's output discharge goes through 1k (TPS22919 9.2.2.2): the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 392.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5a515849-0780-4323-a069-72a48872c8b7"))
(text "   5 V falls in about 3 ms, so the amplifier is off before the codec loses its supply (TPA6132A2 p.12, no pop)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 395.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0c950f61-ff1c-4d6b-81e0-a8f04bc5b318"))
(text "3. Microphone: bias 1.2k + 2.2k (demo board 2.2k + 8.2k, for PC microphones) for phone headsets (Android: 1.8-2.9 V through 2.2k); 1k in series before" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 399.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c04b488d-c540-417a-a46c-0ed529afbc38"))
(text "   MICIN against the step when a plug goes in." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 402.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "789ca1b6-4da5-469e-9d5e-9378bbfdb8f9"))
(text "4. The demo board's two 10 nF capacitors DVDD - DREG18 and DVDD - DREG33 ('close to IC', for ESD) are fitted." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 405.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e115e831-e4de-4b4a-a489-2e0f85e5d79f"))
(text "5. The amplifier's SGND (pin 15) is grounded at the amplifier (its ground pad and a via into the top ground plane), not on a track of its own to the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 409 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "938e3002-ee41-4c48-8f84-e581178e204b"))
(text "   jack's ground pin as TI suggests (datasheet 10.3): with both layers poured the difference is a few millivolts." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 412.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c0b5edb6-dbaf-487b-9b71-f60d70b1ce19"))
(text "6. The four mode jumpers are also strapped with 10k (MODE/ADSEL low, PWRSEL/MSEL high to DREG33) on top of the chip's internal pulls. D105-D107 are" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 415.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7007b668-7687-431f-86e4-c7f0c776a386"))
(text "   bidirectional ESD clamps (PESD5V0S1BA) on the jack's left, right and microphone contacts: a DirectPath output swings below GND, so the clamp must" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 418.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "889302a9-c288-4d1e-8ba4-c24acecd0e3b"))
(text "   be bidirectional." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 422.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21953648-914b-4ea7-8992-d1631ecbde94"))
(text "Key matrix, col2row: column -> switch -> diode (cathode on the row). Labels: (row,col) of each key." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 210 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2dd4f60f-bc5e-4da1-85a7-87badd5ed54d"))
